        "created_at": "2026-01-05T15:45:15.861Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Fanatic: “Ra! Our compatriot Tachyon is performing the ritual of matrimony!  You must attend!”<br>\nRa: “I will go, but only because I choose to do so!”</p>\n<p>I don’t think Doktor Kronz (Kerdinand) was mentioned before this.</p>\n<p>Now excuse me while I go force feed Christopher a Whopper.</p>\n<p>PS, I strongly suspect Lady is Princess Cool.</p>",
